          "notes": [
            "The full actual official2026 scholarship admission article was read. Under 二、奖学金类别及申请条件 the numbered item2 explicitly says 汉语国际教育专业本科生, followed by an undergraduate entry credential; item1 is a separate 国际中文教育专业硕士研究生 and items3-5 are non-degree training. The selected name is a concrete undergraduate programme, not merely the scholarship plan title, an academic direction, or a general faculty.",
            "The same article explicitly says Minzu University is a receiving institution for this scheme, welcomes global learners to study there, and requires 非中国籍人士. This explicitly binds the named bachelor programme to the institution and international audience. Scope is this particular official route at the saved snapshot; it is not a claim that all university programmes accept the award.",
            "All three actual current raw records, all English/Chinese/Russian names, degrees, actual code fields and current identity bindings were independently read. They are One-Semester International Chinese Language Education, One-Semester Chinese Language and Literature, and Chinese Language Study Program; all are non-degree language. The bachelor is a distinct qualification and cannot merge with either direction under a non-degree semester programme. No old bachelor, code, alias or translation establishes an existing same-degree identity.",
            "Only the exact Chinese programme name 汉语国际教育 is approved; no inferred English/Russian translation is created. No official programme or department code is published in this article; numbered scholarship categories and duration are not codes. The source also mentions a masters programme but this action adds only one bachelor to this previously empty visible school.",
            "The past2026 September intake and all duration, HSK, applicant age, fees, amount, funding entitlement, application window and online channels remain source context. This review approves stable identity only, does not refresh current availability or renew scholarship facts. No old STOP or unknown model result is replayed, cleared or used as approval. This is independent source reading, not a model/human receipt.",
            "Compared full existing program-minzu-university-of-china-one-semester-study-program-international-chine; degree=language; all names={\"en\":\"One-Semester Study Program — International Chinese Language Education\",\"zh\":\"一学期研修生（国际中文教育方向）\",\"ru\":\"Односеместровая программа — международное образование в области китайского языка\"}; actual bindings=[]. This non-degree language identity differs from the selected bachelor qualification.",
